WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:30.920
ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

02:08.880 --> 02:10.479
Where is Li Peiyi?

02:11.240 --> 02:13.520
Tell me. I can give you the antidote.

02:17.360 --> 02:18.680
What are you saying?

02:24.200 --> 02:27.160
You think I'll lean in close

02:27.240 --> 02:30.080
and give you a chance to kill me?

02:30.160 --> 02:33.400
Inspector Du, try whatever you want.

02:33.480 --> 02:34.760
I see right through it.

02:41.880 --> 02:44.880
I know your blade is poisoned.

02:44.960 --> 02:48.160
But I added one more herb.

02:48.240 --> 02:52.720
Now, it's already reached your eyes.

02:53.440 --> 02:55.800
If you don't take the antidote in time,

02:56.520 --> 02:58.920
you and I will walk the road

02:59.000 --> 03:01.720
to the underworld together!

03:12.760 --> 03:14.760
I stopped Peiyi

03:14.840 --> 03:17.080
from reopening that old case 15 years ago,

03:17.160 --> 03:18.920
not because I don't want to.

03:19.000 --> 03:21.480
It's because you hid too well.

03:21.560 --> 03:24.040
If we don't find who's behind this,

03:24.640 --> 03:27.760
she'll never be safe.

03:28.760 --> 03:30.600
Let me see

03:31.520 --> 03:34.440
which old acquaintance this is.

04:36.800 --> 04:37.760
Old man?

04:38.680 --> 04:39.920
Old man, wake up!

04:41.080 --> 04:42.240
Where's the antidote?

04:43.760 --> 04:44.920
Where is it?

04:45.560 --> 04:47.680
Old man? Where's the antidote?

04:50.160 --> 04:51.280
Where is it?

04:54.040 --> 04:55.040
Don't scare me.

04:56.520 --> 04:57.800
Don't fall asleep.

04:58.800 --> 05:01.920
Don't scare me. Old man?

05:07.760 --> 05:09.080
Don't leave me…

05:13.720 --> 05:14.840
Don't leave me…

05:16.880 --> 05:18.040
Don't leave me…

05:18.800 --> 05:20.280
Don't leave me…

05:21.120 --> 05:22.720
Why?

05:38.480 --> 05:39.520
Why…

05:40.400 --> 05:41.760
the one still alive…

05:44.040 --> 05:45.000
is…

05:47.040 --> 05:47.880
me?

05:51.280 --> 05:52.120
Peiyi?

05:53.960 --> 05:55.720
Peiyi?

05:58.160 --> 05:59.320
Peiyi?

06:34.800 --> 06:35.880
Old man…

07:35.120 --> 07:36.160
It was you.

07:39.560 --> 07:40.440
You remember now?

07:42.240 --> 07:43.120
Yes.

07:44.880 --> 07:45.720
Good.

07:46.920 --> 07:48.440
Fifteen years ago…

07:50.200 --> 07:53.400
behind the rockery… you saw it all?

07:55.600 --> 07:56.440
No.

07:58.120 --> 08:00.040
Don't think I won't kill you!

08:01.440 --> 08:02.640
You can kill me…

08:04.760 --> 08:05.760
but I didn't lie to you.

08:08.320 --> 08:10.880
I also wish I'd seen it.

08:24.880 --> 08:26.600
My lord. It's time.

08:27.360 --> 08:28.520
Clean this place up.

08:29.120 --> 08:29.960
Understood.

08:36.080 --> 08:37.280
What about after that?

08:38.799 --> 08:40.679
How did you get me out alone?

08:41.559 --> 08:42.640
Who took me into the palace?

08:43.679 --> 08:45.080
I carried you on my back

08:46.560 --> 08:48.360
and climbed the wall
out of the Prince of Duan's manor.

09:20.760 --> 09:21.760
Huaijin!

09:22.520 --> 09:24.760
Huaijin. Huaijin.

09:25.280 --> 09:27.040
Huaijin. What's wrong?

09:32.440 --> 09:33.800
Give her to me.

09:33.880 --> 09:35.400
Hurry! Hurry!

09:48.000 --> 09:48.880
Let's enter the palace.

09:51.400 --> 09:54.320
After that, I passed out.

09:55.160 --> 09:56.560
But I truly cannot recall

09:58.960 --> 10:00.200
what happened after that.

10:04.160 --> 10:05.040
Peiyi!

10:11.920 --> 10:13.200
You can't forget.

10:15.200 --> 10:16.400
How can you forget?

10:17.600 --> 10:18.480
I'm sorry.

10:22.840 --> 10:23.680
Mr. Xiao,

10:24.760 --> 10:27.240
think again… Think again.

10:28.280 --> 10:30.520
Did the man who killed my father
say anything?

10:31.240 --> 10:32.640
What did he sound like?

10:33.280 --> 10:35.200
Was he tall or short? Fat or thin?

10:36.360 --> 10:39.320
Any birthmark? Any scars?

10:39.400 --> 10:40.440
You never forget a face.

10:40.520 --> 10:41.680
There's no way you don't remember!

10:46.640 --> 10:47.840
I'm sorry.

10:48.720 --> 10:51.120
What I saw and remember

10:51.920 --> 10:53.360
isn't any more than you do.

10:53.960 --> 10:56.280
Peiyi, I'm sorry.

10:58.000 --> 10:59.280
Don't say sorry…

11:01.000 --> 11:02.040
Don't say sorry…

11:04.720 --> 11:07.600
Think again. Tell me something else.

11:08.200 --> 11:10.240
Anything you can remember.

11:10.320 --> 11:13.160
Anything. I'm begging you!

11:40.280 --> 11:43.480
Please, leave me alone.

12:52.520 --> 12:53.600
Old man…

12:56.200 --> 12:57.160
Look…

12:59.680 --> 13:01.480
I'm a cursed lone star.

13:03.000 --> 13:04.360
I couldn't find the killer.

13:06.600 --> 13:07.640
And I got you killed.

13:43.600 --> 13:44.440
Your Ladyship.

13:45.920 --> 13:49.320
Should we send Inspector Du's body
back to Western Capital?

13:51.520 --> 13:53.040
He didn't like the capital.

13:53.640 --> 13:55.360
He'd hate being worshiped too.

13:56.400 --> 13:57.840
He lived free and easy.

13:57.920 --> 14:00.880
He used to swing a spear and drink.

14:01.480 --> 14:03.200
Then it was chess and pitch-pot.

14:04.400 --> 14:06.160
Find a high place with a view.

14:06.240 --> 14:07.920
Bury him facing the capital.

14:08.800 --> 14:10.880
So he can see how I'll avenge him.

14:12.800 --> 14:13.640
Understood.

14:53.080 --> 14:54.800
I know you didn't like the capital.

14:57.440 --> 14:58.760
It's quiet here.

15:04.080 --> 15:05.320
No more of me bothering you.

15:14.880 --> 15:16.120
I'm going back for revenge.

15:17.880 --> 15:19.360
The trail is cold, so what?

15:20.600 --> 15:22.640
I've got time and patience.

15:25.040 --> 15:26.560
If you still have a conscience,

15:28.040 --> 15:29.280
watch over me, will you?

17:07.640 --> 17:08.760
Father.

17:10.319 --> 17:11.839
Go home and see your mother.

17:12.440 --> 17:15.079
I have something to tell Her Ladyship.

17:17.160 --> 17:18.359
Mr. Xiao, please leave.

17:19.800 --> 17:20.760
Don't worry.

17:21.800 --> 17:25.079
In rank, in skill, and in words,

17:25.680 --> 17:27.800
I won't humiliate Her Ladyship.

17:29.920 --> 17:30.760
Your Ladyship, please.

17:46.240 --> 17:47.800
You've always kept quiet

17:47.880 --> 17:50.280
about that tragedy
at the Prince of Duan's manor.

17:50.360 --> 17:52.840
And you don't want Deputy Director Xiao
to be deeply involved with me.

17:53.640 --> 17:54.480
But I know

17:55.080 --> 17:57.000
you were not the killer.

17:57.080 --> 18:00.480
So you'd better tell me something
I don't know yet.

18:00.560 --> 18:02.680
Otherwise, there's no deal
left to talk about.

18:05.880 --> 18:08.360
I'm not trying to make you agree

18:08.440 --> 18:09.680
to any conditions.

18:09.760 --> 18:12.920
I'll tell you everything I know.

18:13.640 --> 18:17.480
As for the rest,
Your Ladyship, you decide.

18:18.240 --> 18:19.280
That night,

18:19.360 --> 18:21.560
I heard something happened
at the Prince of Duan's manor,

18:22.080 --> 18:23.680
so I summoned the Crown Prince's guards.

18:24.400 --> 18:26.840
But it wasn't the Prince of Duan
going mad and hurting someone.

18:26.920 --> 18:28.160
It was said

18:28.240 --> 18:30.320
when he campaigned in Jianning,

18:30.400 --> 18:32.720
his Jianning Iron Army

18:32.800 --> 18:35.720
left their post
and slipped into Western Capital

18:35.800 --> 18:37.560
on Lantern Festival night.

18:40.080 --> 18:41.080
So you thought my father

18:41.160 --> 18:42.800
going mad and hurting people
wasn't enough,

18:42.880 --> 18:45.120
and you had to pin treason on him too?

18:46.800 --> 18:48.920
I know the Prince of Duan
was always loyal.

18:49.760 --> 18:51.960
He came back
to the capital early that year

18:52.040 --> 18:54.320
to return his command tally.

18:54.400 --> 18:55.880
But that night,

18:55.960 --> 18:57.440
more than a dozen Jianning Iron Army men

18:57.520 --> 18:59.400
did enter the capital without orders.

19:00.000 --> 19:02.560
This matter couldn't be faked.

19:04.720 --> 19:07.640
Do you think someone plotting rebellion

19:07.720 --> 19:10.280
would make lanterns with his daughter

19:11.240 --> 19:12.720
and watch the moon
with his wife on the very night?

19:13.680 --> 19:15.480
If I didn't find it suspicious,

19:15.560 --> 19:18.200
why would I go
to the Prince of Duan's manor that night?

19:18.800 --> 19:20.040
But when you arrived…

19:20.120 --> 19:22.040
The tragedy had already happened.

19:22.760 --> 19:25.720
The Prince of Duan's manor
was surrounded by the Imperial Guards.

19:25.800 --> 19:27.400
No one could come or go.

19:27.480 --> 19:29.640
I knew it was serious.

19:29.720 --> 19:31.800
The Crown Prince's guards

19:31.880 --> 19:32.760
must not be seen.

19:32.840 --> 19:36.200
So I had them split up
and leave by another route.

19:36.280 --> 19:38.880
I meant to go to the manor
to check the situation.

19:39.440 --> 19:40.560
However,

19:40.640 --> 19:43.520
I ran into Huaijin and you.

19:45.880 --> 19:48.160
So, you sent me into the palace?

19:48.800 --> 19:50.960
No. It wasn't me.

19:55.160 --> 19:57.160
- Let's enter the palace.
- Right now?

19:57.240 --> 19:58.400
That's too risky.

19:58.480 --> 20:01.520
If the Imperial Guards stop us,
what do we do?

20:02.960 --> 20:05.320
If not the palace,
where else can I take her?

20:05.400 --> 20:08.640
After that, how will
you explain to His Majesty?

20:09.280 --> 20:11.720
No matter what, you shouldn't have
shown up here tonight

20:11.800 --> 20:14.760
and, even less, saved her.

20:14.840 --> 20:15.720
Take her back to my manor first,

20:16.320 --> 20:18.920
or find somewhere to settle her for now.

20:19.000 --> 20:22.520
Sir, no one knows what's happening
inside Prince of Duan's manor,

20:22.600 --> 20:26.320
nor how His Majesty will rule on this.

20:26.400 --> 20:28.480
If you get tied to this,

20:28.560 --> 20:30.560
it'll ruin the Xiao family

20:30.640 --> 20:31.880
and the Crown Prince too…

20:31.960 --> 20:33.320
Then what?

20:34.080 --> 20:35.400
Leave her here?

20:35.480 --> 20:37.080
Will she even live to wake up?

20:38.960 --> 20:40.320
Everyone has their fate.

20:40.400 --> 20:41.840
Young Master got her out.

20:41.920 --> 20:43.840
That's already a slim chance.

20:43.920 --> 20:47.480
What comes next isn't for you to decide.

20:52.600 --> 20:54.360
Sir, look.

21:07.360 --> 21:08.840
This is the only way.

21:11.200 --> 21:14.680
I know. I shouldn't drag you
into this, Inspector Du.

21:15.800 --> 21:20.000
But she is the only child
of the Prince of Duan and his consort.

21:20.080 --> 21:23.200
Only by sending her into the palace
could we keep her safe.

21:23.920 --> 21:27.040
But the one who takes her in can't be me.

21:30.760 --> 21:33.360
Her Ladyship is fated for a hard road.

21:33.960 --> 21:37.480
If you're willing, escort her partway.

21:37.560 --> 21:38.560
If you're not…

21:38.640 --> 21:39.960
Then what?

21:41.000 --> 21:42.800
Leave her here to die?

21:44.360 --> 21:45.520
Well, leave her here.

21:46.440 --> 21:47.520
Me?

21:48.040 --> 21:49.560
I don't have much virtue.

21:49.640 --> 21:51.640
Benevolence, righteousness,
rites, wisdom, faith…

21:51.720 --> 21:53.400
I can live without any of it.

21:53.480 --> 21:55.320
Mr. Du, you can't just watch her die!

22:00.160 --> 22:01.680
Hypocritical scholar.

22:04.680 --> 22:05.800
Well said, Mr. Du.

22:08.240 --> 22:09.920
I can take her into the palace.

22:10.680 --> 22:12.240
But after tonight,

22:12.880 --> 22:15.400
you and I are strangers.

22:15.480 --> 22:18.800
This child's life
was saved by you and your son.

22:19.800 --> 22:24.880
However, from now on,
you may never hear her thank-you.

22:25.640 --> 22:28.520
I'm deeply ashamed. I'm not worthy.

22:29.520 --> 22:32.440
Mr. Du, I'll leave her to you.

22:34.280 --> 22:35.120
Keeping her alive

22:35.880 --> 22:38.560
shouldn't be hard. Come.

22:40.480 --> 22:43.480
Won't you ask why I came tonight?

22:44.560 --> 22:46.360
I've seen all kinds of people.

22:46.880 --> 22:48.600
I've never misjudged one.

22:49.760 --> 22:51.280
Mr. Du, you're a man of honor!

22:52.400 --> 22:54.120
Inspector Du reported to His Majesty

22:54.200 --> 22:58.440
that he had found you in a corner
of the Prince of Duan's manor.

22:58.520 --> 23:01.200
He suggested
you had fainted from the shock

23:01.280 --> 23:02.440
of the sudden chaos in the manor.

23:03.120 --> 23:06.360
His Majesty and the entire court

23:06.440 --> 23:07.760
were waiting for you to wake up,

23:08.800 --> 23:11.640
each harboring their own intentions,
waiting to hear from you

23:11.720 --> 23:13.320
what happened that night

23:13.400 --> 23:15.160
at the Prince of Duan's manor.

23:16.560 --> 23:18.080
But I didn't remember anything.

23:19.560 --> 23:23.040
I only remembered Father
making lanterns with me before bed.

23:23.640 --> 23:25.480
I woke up an orphan.

23:28.000 --> 23:30.040
Even that alone

23:30.920 --> 23:33.040
was enough to get you killed.

23:33.920 --> 23:36.320
Inspector Du and I were always on guard.

23:36.840 --> 23:39.760
Your fall into Moonlit Pond
was no accident.

23:39.840 --> 23:42.640
But the scariest part

23:43.200 --> 23:44.960
wasn't that they dared to hurt you.

23:46.280 --> 23:47.880
It was that

23:48.960 --> 23:51.800
they did it on purpose right in front
of you and Deputy Director Xiao.

23:52.520 --> 23:53.840
They knew you'd saved me.

23:53.920 --> 23:56.840
I was not sure, and I couldn't prove it.

23:57.920 --> 23:59.440
Whether they knew or not,

24:00.000 --> 24:03.280
to me, that was a warning.

24:03.920 --> 24:05.400
They were warning you

24:06.040 --> 24:10.120
not to get involved with me and never
dig into the Prince of Duan's case.

24:10.840 --> 24:13.640
All I could hope was you'd never remember.

24:14.320 --> 24:16.800
At least then, you'd be safe.

24:17.440 --> 24:20.920
And Huaijin and I would be safe too.

24:21.840 --> 24:23.320
I just never expected

24:24.600 --> 24:25.960
you'd remember anyway.

24:27.960 --> 24:29.520
I dragged down your family

24:30.680 --> 24:31.880
and got my master killed.

24:33.520 --> 24:35.240
I can't change the past.

24:35.920 --> 24:38.680
From now on, I will sever all ties

24:38.760 --> 24:40.720
with your family and Deputy Director Xiao.

24:42.960 --> 24:44.400
I came to you

24:44.480 --> 24:46.400
not to protect my family.

24:47.000 --> 24:50.800
Huaijin is gentle, kind-hearted,

24:50.880 --> 24:52.440
but as stubborn as you.

24:52.520 --> 24:54.640
He's made up his mind to investigate.

24:55.240 --> 24:59.120
Even if you cut ties with him,
he'll keep digging.

25:01.040 --> 25:02.720
Let fate take its course

25:04.040 --> 25:05.720
for my family.

25:07.040 --> 25:08.960
But all this started because of me.

25:09.480 --> 25:10.680
I can't do nothing.

25:11.680 --> 25:13.600
Then please trust him.

25:13.680 --> 25:15.720
Huaijin never meant to hide it.

25:16.400 --> 25:19.800
Back then, he was only a teenager.

25:21.080 --> 25:22.320
These past 15 years,

25:22.960 --> 25:25.760
he's tried desperately
to forget that night

25:26.520 --> 25:28.280
and hoped you would too.

25:29.160 --> 25:30.560
Because he knows the pain

25:30.640 --> 25:32.800
of waking from nightmares
night after night.

25:34.520 --> 25:37.120
But upon learning
your resolve to uncover the truth,

25:37.200 --> 25:38.720
he forced himself

25:38.800 --> 25:41.440
to relive that night, over and over.

25:41.520 --> 25:44.120
He'd throw himself back

25:44.200 --> 25:46.440
into that nightmare repeatedly,

25:46.520 --> 25:49.160
if only to remember the smallest detail.

25:51.200 --> 25:53.800
I admit I had my own motives.

25:54.880 --> 25:57.480
For my family, for the Crown Prince,

25:57.560 --> 26:01.080
for the situation at court,
I might hold things back.

26:01.680 --> 26:03.240
But Huaijin never did.

26:04.000 --> 26:05.760
From start to finish,

26:06.640 --> 26:08.280
he only wanted to keep you safe,

26:08.920 --> 26:10.560
just as he did that night.

26:54.960 --> 26:56.800
You bought this sachet
for your sweetheart, right?

26:57.520 --> 26:59.840
What sweetheart? Stop talking nonsense.

27:01.400 --> 27:03.360
She's been tailing us all day.

27:20.640 --> 27:22.280
JIN NIANG

27:22.880 --> 27:24.160
You're really heartless.

27:25.120 --> 27:26.040
Hey…

27:26.560 --> 27:27.440
Peiyi.

27:31.760 --> 27:33.040
Pardon my rudeness.

27:34.040 --> 27:35.400
I'm the one being rude,

27:35.480 --> 27:37.440
calling you by name like that.

27:40.480 --> 27:44.720
Your master used to call you "that girl"

27:44.800 --> 27:46.440
all the time,

27:46.960 --> 27:48.720
in a tone that was half annoyed,

27:48.800 --> 27:50.160
half proud,

27:50.240 --> 27:52.680
like you were his own daughter.

27:54.320 --> 27:56.680
Old man never said a kind word about me?

27:57.720 --> 28:01.120
He was a good man,
just with a sharp tongue.

28:01.840 --> 28:03.800
So I picked up his bad habits.

28:07.320 --> 28:09.160
When I first met him,

28:09.240 --> 28:11.560
he was a general's son,

28:11.640 --> 28:13.720
and I was just a merchant's daughter.

28:14.720 --> 28:16.880
He always looked after me,

28:17.720 --> 28:18.920
and I…

28:20.440 --> 28:21.400
I had feelings for him too.

28:22.000 --> 28:23.160
But later,

28:23.240 --> 28:24.960
his father was convicted.

28:25.680 --> 28:28.400
As a traitor's son, he entered the palace

28:28.920 --> 28:30.560
and joined
the Palace Investigation Bureau.

28:32.800 --> 28:35.240
Your Ladyship, you should know

28:35.920 --> 28:39.120
women like me have to survive somehow.

28:40.040 --> 28:41.320
That's enough.

28:42.040 --> 28:44.880
I understand. I was out of line.

28:47.600 --> 28:51.960
Truth is, after he entered the palace,
we never lost touch.

28:52.600 --> 28:54.640
He still took care of me.

28:55.880 --> 28:57.080
But…

29:00.600 --> 29:02.000
But I knew

29:03.320 --> 29:05.120
we could never be.

29:07.080 --> 29:08.120
He told me

29:08.960 --> 29:10.960
he wasn't alone anymore.

29:11.040 --> 29:12.560
Now there was someone

29:13.200 --> 29:16.520
he was wholly devoted to protecting.

29:22.480 --> 29:24.240
He was barely able

29:25.240 --> 29:26.640
to save himself,

29:27.440 --> 29:29.040
yet still tried to shield others.

29:36.840 --> 29:38.040
This sachet

29:39.560 --> 29:41.040
was his gift to you.

29:42.720 --> 29:44.520
Now that he's gone,

29:45.720 --> 29:47.200
I'm giving it back.

29:47.960 --> 29:49.240
Keep it as a memory.

29:51.880 --> 29:52.760
No, you keep it.

29:53.400 --> 29:54.920
It's all he left you.

29:55.000 --> 29:58.480
But my skills, my nasty temper,

29:59.120 --> 30:02.400
and this sharp mouth of mine
all came from him.

30:17.840 --> 30:21.280
If you're avenging him, count me in, okay?

30:23.240 --> 30:24.320
Don't get involved.

30:26.040 --> 30:27.800
You may look down on me,

30:28.360 --> 30:31.160
but people like me have our own channels.

30:33.160 --> 30:35.560
You don't know me,
but you know the old man, don't you?

30:36.160 --> 30:37.240
I'm the same as him.

30:37.320 --> 30:39.080
If I looked down on you,

30:39.160 --> 30:41.160
I wouldn't waste one more word.

30:41.920 --> 30:43.360
This is truly dangerous.

30:45.240 --> 30:48.200
If you need anything later,
this sachet will be your pass to see me.

30:49.280 --> 30:51.880
I heard someone is asking
about sudden eye trouble.

30:52.720 --> 30:53.800
Is it you

30:53.880 --> 30:56.160
who are hunting Mr. Du's killer?

31:01.920 --> 31:04.920
Don't worry. You haven't been exposed.

31:05.000 --> 31:08.600
I pieced it together
after I knew Mr. Du's death.

31:10.320 --> 31:13.360
My ways of getting news
aren't exactly clean,

31:14.040 --> 31:15.600
but they can still be useful.

31:18.520 --> 31:19.560
Then I'll leave it to you.

31:20.560 --> 31:22.360
Please, stay safe.

31:22.440 --> 31:23.720
You must take greater care.

31:23.800 --> 31:27.200
He worried about you the most.

31:35.480 --> 31:36.640
I failed.

31:37.640 --> 31:41.160
Du Zhixing showed up out of nowhere
and let Li Peiyi get away.

31:41.840 --> 31:43.480
But since Du Zhixing is dead,

31:43.560 --> 31:45.960
it will be hard for Li Peiyi to trace us.

31:48.920 --> 31:50.120
What's wrong with your eye?

31:50.880 --> 31:52.520
It was hurt by Du Zhixing.

31:53.240 --> 31:54.520
I haven't treated it yet.

31:56.880 --> 31:58.680
If it can't be cured,

31:59.560 --> 32:01.200
won't it be easy to track you down?

32:03.200 --> 32:04.400
I'll do everything I can to treat it!

32:04.480 --> 32:07.000
Until it's cured,
I won't show my face again!

32:10.280 --> 32:14.160
Before you disappear,
make sure everything is settled.

32:14.800 --> 32:16.400
No more mistakes.

32:20.280 --> 32:22.880
Before Li Peiyi
returned to the Western Capital,

32:22.960 --> 32:23.880
she met someone.

32:26.520 --> 32:27.600
You couldn't find out who?

32:29.200 --> 32:32.920
No. But… besides us,

32:33.560 --> 32:34.560
someone else is watching her.

32:36.280 --> 32:37.600
I'll look into it.

32:45.320 --> 32:46.320
Tell me,

32:47.240 --> 32:48.440
if you die,

32:49.760 --> 32:52.240
Li Peiyi will have no way
to trace us, right?

32:54.760 --> 32:57.480
PALACE INVESTIGATION BUREAU

32:59.480 --> 33:00.520
Boss.

33:04.760 --> 33:06.240
What are you doing?

33:07.280 --> 33:08.280
Stacking grapes?

33:09.000 --> 33:10.800
Yeah. Look.

33:11.600 --> 33:14.080
This second grape can barely stay on.

33:14.160 --> 33:17.000
But the moment I add a third,
the whole thing collapses.

33:17.880 --> 33:19.080
Sounds like me, doesn't it?

33:22.440 --> 33:24.680
Boss, just put the third one on.

33:31.000 --> 33:32.440
Now even the second won't hold.

33:35.560 --> 33:36.880
What case has dragged on this long?

33:37.800 --> 33:40.280
Boss, you won't believe it.

33:40.880 --> 33:42.120
The plants by Penglai Pool

33:42.200 --> 33:44.040
have been dying lately
with the season change.

33:44.120 --> 33:46.920
Even the magnolias His Majesty
gave Brilliant Lady Dou have lost a few.

33:47.520 --> 33:50.360
But she insists someone sabotaged them,

33:50.440 --> 33:52.320
using dead magnolias to curse her.

33:52.400 --> 33:53.400
She demanded I get to the bottom of it.

33:54.400 --> 33:57.120
I worked day and night for three days,

33:57.200 --> 33:59.480
and no one went near those plants.

33:59.560 --> 34:01.400
Then I asked the chief gardener
at the Bureau of Gardens.

34:01.480 --> 34:04.480
She said this season,
plants dying is normal.

34:04.560 --> 34:07.920
I was about to close the case, but then…

34:12.080 --> 34:15.280
But then a magnolia
fell over right in front of me.

34:16.000 --> 34:17.920
The soil around the tree
was clearly disturbed.

34:18.520 --> 34:21.800
I've had men guarding
near Penglai Pool. It can't be.

34:24.360 --> 34:25.600
What are you doing?

34:26.960 --> 34:28.280
Helping you fix your problems.

34:34.199 --> 34:37.960
Boss, help me fix mine too.

34:38.040 --> 34:39.960
This is really creepy.

34:40.600 --> 34:42.719
What if one day I die too?

34:42.800 --> 34:44.120
You'll still have to solve cases yourself.

34:44.719 --> 34:45.719
Boss!

34:47.800 --> 34:49.679
Can you stop saying that?

34:50.360 --> 34:51.560
It's been a month.

34:52.400 --> 34:54.719
If Inspector Du knew
you were like this every day,

34:54.800 --> 34:56.040
he'd crawl out and curse you out.

34:57.600 --> 34:58.720
I'd love that.

35:00.440 --> 35:03.600
Boss, I really don't know what to do.

35:04.640 --> 35:07.040
I can't say what happened before.

35:07.120 --> 35:08.680
But these three days, me and the guards

35:08.760 --> 35:09.880
have been watching day and night.

35:09.960 --> 35:12.960
And that tree still toppled straight over!

35:15.000 --> 35:17.400
Brilliant Lady Dou is arrogant.

35:17.480 --> 35:18.720
If someone set her up,

35:18.800 --> 35:20.640
that's not exactly shocking.

35:21.240 --> 35:24.600
But His Majesty gave her nine magnolias,
meant to last long.

35:25.280 --> 35:28.760
This past month, four have already died.

35:28.840 --> 35:31.960
Now, only five are left.

35:32.040 --> 35:34.200
What's wrong with five? Isn't five good?

35:34.280 --> 35:37.000
Five reads the same as none.

35:37.080 --> 35:38.400
Brilliant Lady Dou is furious.

35:38.480 --> 35:39.760
She insists we drag that person out.

35:40.760 --> 35:41.880
And if we can't find them?

35:41.960 --> 35:43.880
If we can't,

35:45.120 --> 35:46.760
then I'm done for too.

35:46.840 --> 35:49.480
Then our bureau is done for.

35:52.040 --> 35:52.960
Where's your county princess?

35:53.040 --> 35:54.360
Have her come out and see me!

35:54.440 --> 35:55.400
My lady,

35:56.120 --> 35:57.440
Her Ladyship is resting.

35:58.040 --> 35:59.200
At a time like this?

35:59.280 --> 36:01.760
Something this big happened,
and she can still rest?

36:01.840 --> 36:03.000
Peiyi?

36:03.080 --> 36:05.040
Li Peiyi? Get out here!

36:06.800 --> 36:09.040
- What are you doing?
- She came for you. Where are you going?

36:09.120 --> 36:10.120
None of your business.

36:11.360 --> 36:13.240
Fine, I won't meddle.

36:14.520 --> 36:16.000
We were partners,
and now you're selling me out?

36:16.080 --> 36:18.000
We were partners,
and now you're ditching me?

36:21.360 --> 36:23.880
My lady, you're here.

36:23.960 --> 36:26.560
Peiyi, I know what you're like.

36:26.640 --> 36:28.080
No one in the capital

36:28.160 --> 36:30.240
can make you do anything.

36:30.320 --> 36:31.680
So…

36:33.680 --> 36:35.840
My lady, what are you trying to do?

36:35.920 --> 36:39.640
Today I'll show you exactly what I'm like.

36:41.720 --> 36:43.680
Are you trying to see

36:43.760 --> 36:45.320
how long I can camp here?

36:45.920 --> 36:48.480
Are you thinking,
"Fine, I'll just walk away?"

36:49.280 --> 36:50.880
Back when I made a mistake,

36:50.960 --> 36:53.760
His Majesty swore never to see me again.

36:54.480 --> 36:57.680
I was just a helpless woman,
with no family backing

36:57.760 --> 36:59.400
and no special talents.

36:59.480 --> 37:01.080
I had only one thing left,

37:02.560 --> 37:06.080
persistence.
Even the hardest heart can be moved.

37:06.160 --> 37:08.720
His Majesty isn't made of stone.

37:09.360 --> 37:12.040
And I can tell you aren't either.

37:13.160 --> 37:14.520
No worries.

37:15.200 --> 37:16.360
I can wait.

37:16.960 --> 37:19.880
In all of Xingqing Palace,
only you can find who harmed me.

37:19.960 --> 37:21.400
If you won't help me,

37:21.480 --> 37:23.160
I'll ask help from His Majesty.

37:23.760 --> 37:25.720
Someone dares stir up trouble
in the inner palace?

37:25.800 --> 37:27.600
I'll fight them to the end!

37:29.640 --> 37:31.440
You're using Consort Shu to threaten me?

37:32.400 --> 37:34.880
Peiyi, what are you saying?

37:34.960 --> 37:38.440
From start to finish,
when did I ever mention Consort Shu?

37:39.280 --> 37:42.640
If I don't help you investigate,
you'll take it to His Majesty.

37:43.240 --> 37:44.960
If someone's cursing in the inner palace,

37:45.040 --> 37:46.640
the blame will naturally fall
on Consort Shu.

37:46.720 --> 37:48.000
How could it?

37:48.080 --> 37:51.200
Everyone knows the one His Majesty
favors most is Consort Shu.

37:53.920 --> 37:55.920
I've seen how you are.

37:56.600 --> 37:57.920
Fine. I'll take the case.

37:59.920 --> 38:00.880
That easy?

38:02.200 --> 38:04.760
Then I'll wait for your news.

38:10.920 --> 38:13.320
Anything wrong on Consort Shu's side?

38:14.880 --> 38:16.120
The Right Chancellor messed up.

38:16.640 --> 38:19.160
No idea what it was,
but it made His Majesty furious.

38:19.240 --> 38:21.680
Lately, His Majesty
hasn't visited Consort Shu at all.

38:23.360 --> 38:25.920
Even Brilliant Lady Dou dares use her.

38:26.000 --> 38:27.240
It can't be small.

38:27.840 --> 38:28.680
Then what do we do?

38:30.440 --> 38:33.560
Tomorrow, take men to fertilize
the plants by Penglai Pool.

38:33.640 --> 38:35.240
Don't miss an inch of soil.

38:35.840 --> 38:37.320
If anyone asks,

38:37.400 --> 38:40.200
tell them you'll do whatever it takes
to save Brilliant Lady Dou's magnolias.

38:41.240 --> 38:42.760
I meant the Right Chancellor.

38:42.840 --> 38:44.120
Want me to go sniff around?

38:44.720 --> 38:46.400
You can even dig into court matters?

38:46.480 --> 38:48.240
What's so hard about that?

38:48.320 --> 38:51.480
Unless it's something only His Majesty
and the Right Chancellor know.

38:51.560 --> 38:54.120
As long as a third person knows,
I can find out.

38:55.240 --> 38:56.960
Everyone knows you're my man.

38:57.040 --> 38:59.400
And I was raised by Consort Shu. So…

38:59.480 --> 39:00.440
So…

39:01.040 --> 39:03.200
It's not me prying into court secrets.

39:03.280 --> 39:04.360
It's Consort Shu.

39:04.960 --> 39:06.960
I was wrong, Your Ladyship.

39:07.040 --> 39:09.000
I'll have people fertilize right away.

39:15.680 --> 39:17.320
All of you, eyes open.

39:17.400 --> 39:19.120
Don't miss a single flower or tree.

39:19.200 --> 39:20.280
- Understood.
- Understood.

39:40.960 --> 39:44.440
Boss, you don't have
to camp here every day.

39:44.520 --> 39:46.120
That person hasn't shown up lately.

39:46.720 --> 39:48.080
They probably know you're on it

39:48.160 --> 39:50.760
- and don't dare make a move.
- Sweet talker.

39:52.400 --> 39:53.560
Because your grapes are sweet.

39:55.760 --> 39:57.960
One more gross line,
and you will solve it yourself.

39:58.800 --> 39:59.720
Okay. I'll stop.

40:00.520 --> 40:02.800
I just don't want you waiting here.

40:02.880 --> 40:05.480
Before, when Brilliant Lady Dou
had you investigate,

40:05.560 --> 40:06.800
they still kept doing it.

40:07.640 --> 40:10.360
So either they were sure
they wouldn't get caught

40:10.960 --> 40:13.680
or they had to come, no matter what.

40:14.320 --> 40:17.680
After all this tight guarding,
they should be itching to act.

40:18.280 --> 40:19.520
So they'll come tonight?

40:19.600 --> 40:22.480
Not sure, but we can try our luck.

40:23.920 --> 40:24.960
Ma Xiaoran,

40:25.920 --> 40:27.880
have everyone look around.
See anything unusual.

40:28.480 --> 40:29.520
Understood.

40:31.760 --> 40:33.480
Your Ladyship, right here.

40:35.480 --> 40:37.040
This is insane.

40:37.120 --> 40:38.640
No way.

40:38.720 --> 40:40.480
We've been guarding nearby.

40:40.560 --> 40:41.600
There's only one path here.

40:41.680 --> 40:42.680
How is this possible?

40:43.360 --> 40:45.680
Once we catch them, we'll ask and know.

40:49.160 --> 40:50.240
Don't go in.

40:55.880 --> 40:58.800
These are… footprints!

40:59.400 --> 41:00.520
Where'd they come from?

41:00.600 --> 41:02.920
From someone

41:03.000 --> 41:05.400
slipping in under your nose,
leaving tracks behind.

41:10.800 --> 41:11.760
We caught them!

41:12.560 --> 41:13.720
Where are they?

41:13.800 --> 41:14.920
You'll see in a second.

41:17.040 --> 41:17.880
CHENXIANG PAVILION

41:17.960 --> 41:20.720
It's cold. Warm your feet, everyone.

41:24.840 --> 41:25.800
Go on, warm up!

41:41.040 --> 41:44.240
- What?
- Secretary Pan, so it was you.

41:45.000 --> 41:46.280
Hold him down!

41:47.680 --> 41:48.640
What's going on?

41:48.720 --> 41:51.200
The flowerbeds
were just heavily fertilized.

41:51.280 --> 41:53.280
The fertilizer was mixed
with actinolite and alum clay.

41:53.360 --> 41:56.400
Anyone who dug in the beds
would get them on their soles.

41:56.480 --> 41:58.080
Heat those two together,

41:58.160 --> 41:59.440
and they'll pop like fireworks.

41:59.520 --> 42:01.400
But the beds were all fertilized.

42:01.480 --> 42:02.560
I patrolled here all night.

42:03.160 --> 42:04.000
I stepped on it by accident.

42:04.080 --> 42:05.120
That's normal!

42:05.200 --> 42:06.520
Fair point.

42:07.480 --> 42:09.080
Soles alone prove nothing.

42:09.760 --> 42:12.120
But if you dug, you used your hands.

42:14.240 --> 42:15.320
A little heat will tell.

42:19.480 --> 42:20.600
Heat them.

42:26.240 --> 42:28.280
It was me!

42:32.880 --> 42:34.080
It was me…

42:36.760 --> 42:37.880
Talk.

42:38.880 --> 42:39.840
What are these?

42:43.000 --> 42:45.160
If you won't say, then I will.

42:46.200 --> 42:47.760
This is no common fruit.

42:47.840 --> 42:48.840
They're ginseng seeds.

42:49.600 --> 42:51.240
The Imperial Medical Office
supplies them only to His Majesty.

42:51.320 --> 42:54.480
Few in the entire palace
have access to such medicine.

42:54.560 --> 42:55.640
Where did you obtain them?

42:56.240 --> 42:57.120
I…

42:58.840 --> 42:59.720
I dug them up under the tree.

42:59.800 --> 43:02.840
Why were ginseng seeds
buried under a magnolia tree?

43:05.360 --> 43:07.760
What's the charge
for stealing royal property?

43:07.840 --> 43:08.960
High treason.

43:09.040 --> 43:11.080
- And the sentence?
- Strangling.

43:11.160 --> 43:13.440
Steal something valuable
or serious enough,

43:13.520 --> 43:15.400
and your clan gets dragged in.

43:17.080 --> 43:19.280
- How many clans?
- At least three.

43:19.360 --> 43:21.640
If it's worse, nine.
